    "detailed_description": "Explore a strange house and keep it clean as an 8 cm character, <strong>Tabi</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/5abcf704d37d979d028bcc496c49e4d7.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfKeep the house clean</strong><br>The house is infested with mucky creatures called <strong>Dorodoros</strong>.<br>Purify them with your <strong>Mind Bucket</strong> to keep the house clean.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/5b633448d5de346dc072e213012e199e.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfCollect Memories</strong><br>Search every corner of the house and collect <strong>Memories</strong> to unlock new abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/23ab33a2f52555656ead2ae445413283.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfMeet the residents</strong><br>The house has a lot of odd residents and each has their own problems.<br>You might be the one who can help.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/d7160f38b36650d495d65eab3bc4ba53.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore a strange house and keep it clean as an 8 cm character, <strong>Tabi</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/5abcf704d37d979d028bcc496c49e4d7.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfKeep the house clean</strong><br>The house is infested with mucky creatures called <strong>Dorodoros</strong>.<br>Purify them with your <strong>Mind Bucket</strong> to keep the house clean.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/5b633448d5de346dc072e213012e199e.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfCollect Memories</strong><br>Search every corner of the house and collect <strong>Memories</strong> to unlock new abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/23ab33a2f52555656ead2ae445413283.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25cfMeet the residents</strong><br>The house has a lot of odd residents and each has their own problems.<br>You might be the one who can help.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118420/extras/d7160f38b36650d495d65eab3bc4ba53.avif?t=1727590028\" width=616 height=300 /></span>",
